# .hermesrules — novanurachman.my.id

## Tech Stack
- Backend: Go + Fiber v2, port 8084 (systemd: `nova-server`), binary `backend/bin/nova-server`
- Frontend: React 18 + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind → static build `frontend/dist/`, disajikan nginx
- Database: MySQL `nova_profile` (akses root via `sudo -n mysql nova_profile`)
- Auth: JWT + bcrypt; Admin: `frontend/src/pages/admin/` (Login, Dashboard, Profile, CrudPage, Contacts)
- Deploy: `git push origin main` → GitHub Actions build → rsync ke VPS. **JANGAN build di server.**
- Serving: nginx → Go; HTML `no-cache`, hashed assets `immutable` 1 tahun

## Arsitektur
- `backend/cmd/server/main.go` — entrypoint + routes (SPA catch-all HARUS paling akhir)
- `backend/internal/` — handlers, database, middleware (JWT guard, CSRF, RateLimit, SecurityHeaders)
- `backend/migrations/` — schema + seed SQL (005 = visitor_logs)
- `frontend/src/pages/public/` — Home, Projects, Experience, Skills, Contact (detail per slug)
- `frontend/src/lib/` — api client, auth context, lang.tsx (multi-lang t(en,id))
- CMS modules: Profile · Projects · Experience · Skills · Messages — baca DB per-request (tanpa rebuild)
- Visitor counter: middleware `handlers.VisitorCounter` + GET `/api/visitors`; PWA: `manifest.json` + `sw.js` di public/

## Status Terakhir (cek 2026-08-31)
- ✅ Blog module live: tabel `posts` (006_posts.sql), `/api/posts`, `/api/posts/:slug`, RSS `/feed.xml` (goldmark), sitemap + SEO meta per post, admin CRUD di `/admin/posts` (tab EN/ID + preview markdown + publish terjadwal), halaman publik `/blog` + `/blog/:slug`. Deps: `marked` + `dompurify` (frontend), `goldmark` (backend).
- ⚠️ **Timezone fix penting**: DSN pakai `loc=Asia/Jakarta` — tanpanya semua TIMESTAMP bergeser +7 jam (parseTime=true default-nya UTC). Jangan hapus.
- Admin layout: sidebar grouped desktop + bottom nav mobile (5 slot, "Lainnya" = sheet).
- HEAD: commit blog sprint (lihat git log). visitor_logs: ~881 rows, tanpa retention policy.
- Ponytail config FULL untuk review/audit
- Admin CRUD: hanya whitelisted columns; login uniform error (anti user enumeration)
- SEO meta di-inject per route dari tabel `seo_meta` oleh backend
- Design: dark-first `#08090B`, accent `#4ADE80`, Inter + JetBrains Mono, min 44px touch target
- Selalu update file ini saat ada perubahan struktur/status
